    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/c2edb2ce15c56b47c36a75f9b7feb0aa.poster.avif?t=1747401983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/c2edb2ce15c56b47c36a75f9b7feb0aa.webm?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/c2edb2ce15c56b47c36a75f9b7feb0aa.mp4?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Flipping Legend DX is not for the faint of heart, but the rules are simple:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Move diagonally on a grid, like a bishop in chess<br></li><li>Flip backward to switch between light to dark squares<br></li><li>Smash enemies fast to maintain your health and rack up points</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unlock tons of characters each with a unique special ability</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/3cbada8f04683310c570ec00df6677d1.poster.avif?t=1747401983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/3cbada8f04683310c570ec00df6677d1.webm?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/3cbada8f04683310c570ec00df6677d1.mp4?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade characters to get the most out of every run</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/4c6111055e8e3463609148e2b5597c73.poster.avif?t=1747401983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/4c6111055e8e3463609148e2b5597c73.webm?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/4c6111055e8e3463609148e2b5597c73.mp4?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Reveal portals to farther, more dangerous lands</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/27cbee35f31e9e814254c6ef5124a4aa.poster.avif?t=1747401983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/27cbee35f31e9e814254c6ef5124a4aa.webm?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/668640/extras/27cbee35f31e9e814254c6ef5124a4aa.mp4?t=1747401983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete with friends and strangers for high scores on the leaderboards</strong></h2>",
